{"id":"cbc511d49acde4c7","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability.md","title":"可判定矩阵的真值与数实现性","display":"thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability — 可判定矩阵的真值与数实现性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability","aliases":["72-thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability"],"display":"thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability — 可判定矩阵的真值与数实现性","depends_on":["[[72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment]]","[[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]","[[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]"],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI numerical realizability and canonical-realizer discussion §§1.4–1.10, print413–415/PDF425–427; local decidable-matrix extension","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability — 可判定矩阵的真值与数实现性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"117d071027580882\" href=\"?note=117d071027580882\" title=\"72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment\">72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ac651a11b295edf3\" href=\"?note=ac651a11b295edf3\" title=\"72-df-kleene-number-realizability\">72-df-kleene-number-realizability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2ce276183c963d6c\" href=\"?note=2ce276183c963d6c\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth\">72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI numerical realizability and canonical-realizer discussion §§1.4–1.10, print413–415/PDF425–427; local decidable-matrix extension"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal Q_a\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal Q_a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；固定可接受编号及其全部部分递归函数的满枚举性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NR}(n,A,\\eta)\\Longrightarrow\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ \\mathsf{NR}(n,A,\\eta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NR}(n,A,\\eta)\\Longrightarrow\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ \\mathsf{NR}(n,A,\\eta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按无量词公式同时证明两方向，并用一个对有限数参数全定义的递归构造给真公式提供实现者。原子取0；合取配对；析取计算两个分支的可判定真值，选一个真分支并附0/1标签。蕴涵在后件为真时返回后件的典范实现者，在前件为假时任取索引，因为前件无实现者。反向利用前件真时可构造的实现者取得后件真。有限项算术和布尔求值可计算，s-m-n 将所需常函数及参数化构造编码。这里只覆盖无量词矩阵，不将结论推广到任意含量词的 NR 公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment","status":"resolved","id":"117d071027580882","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-kleene-number-realizability","status":"resolved","id":"ac651a11b295edf3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth","status":"resolved","id":"2ce276183c963d6c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal Q_a","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NR}(n,A,\\eta)\\Longrightarrow\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ \\mathsf{NR}(n,A,\\eta).","display":true}],"bytes":1918,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增9项：[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]] · [[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]] · [[72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code]] · [[72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment]] · [[72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix]] · [[72-lem-applicative-semantic-substitution]] · [[72-lem-realizability-environment-locality]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-representation]] · [[72-thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增9项：[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]] · [[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]] · [[72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code]] · [[72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment]] 